{"version":1,"content":"<p>沙特阿拉伯位於首都利雅得的哈立德國王國際機場上周六（10日）遭襲擊，已造成12人死亡、309人受傷。</p><p>中國駐沙特阿拉伯大使館周日（11日）表示，目前尚無中國公民傷亡報告。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T06:57:58.695281+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":85,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-11T05:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T08:37:42.910727+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"98b27df2d1eb9b89f315f5056b5fc091a650b67e47a9b215ee2241059b3a22d1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}